{
  "slug": "google-multi-account",
  "name": "Google Multi Account",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Connect multiple Google accounts (Gmail + Calendar) to Claude via MCP. Search emails, read threads, create drafts, send messages, list calendar events, create events, and find free time across all your Google accounts. Just tell Claude which account to use and it routes to the right one. Includes a guided /setup command that walks you through GCP project creation, OAuth authentication, and server registration.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **3 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `google-setup` (This skill provides guidance for setting up the Google Multi-Account MCP plugin)\n- **Commands** (3): `add-account` (Add another Google account to the Multi-Account MCP), `reauth` (Re-authorize your connected Google accounts (after a scope change or expired token)), `setup` (Set up Google Multi-Account MCP — connect your Google accounts)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `google-multi`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install google-multi-account@claude-community` from `stevegustafson32/google-multi-account`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
